us powers, and should be used when other processes have been exhausted rather than for fishing expeditions; (b) senators seeking to order the production of documents should consider paragraph (a) and refine their orders accordingly; and (c) notes that Senator Payman has been offered multiple briefings by the Minister for Communications on various topics related to online safety and the senator has declined these offers. Sue Lines The question is that the amendment as moved by Minister Gallagher to general business notice of motion No. 323 be agreed to.","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9869","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2026-02-04/16"}
